
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    actor U as User
    participant UI as Chat UI
    participant CM as Connection Manager
    participant DM as Discovery Manager
    participant UDP as UDP Network
    participant Other as Other Users
    participant DB as Contact Database

    U->>UI: Enter nickname
    U->>UI: Click Connect
    UI->>CM: connect(nickname)

    Note over CM,Other: Discover users on the network

    CM->>DM: startDiscovery()
    DM->>UDP: DISCOVERY_REQUEST
    UDP-->>Other: DISCOVERY_REQUEST

    Other->>UDP: DISCOVERY_RESPONSE (nickname, IP)
    UDP-->>DM: DISCOVERY_RESPONSE

    DM->>DB: Store discovered contacts
    DB-->>DM: Contacts list

    DM-->>CM: Return discovered contacts

    Note over CM,DB: Check nickname uniqueness locally

    CM->>DB: isNicknameAvailable(nickname)
    DB-->>CM: Availability result

    alt Nickname already in use
        CM-->>UI: Connection rejected
        UI-->>U: Display error
    else Nickname available
        CM->>DM: announcePresence(nickname)
        DM->>UDP: USER_JOINED (nickname, IP)
        UDP-->>Other: USER_JOINED
        Other->>DB: Add new contact
        Other->>UI: Update contact list

        CM-->>UI: Connection successful
        UI-->>U: Display contact list
    end
